  "description": "Unleash Your Ride with the Ultimate Enduro Beast!\n\nGet ready to dominate the trails with HPC’s groundbreaking full-carbon enduro bike—our first all-new full-suspension marvel in three years! The Engineered for adrenaline junkies and adventure seekers alike, this lightweight powerhouse redefines trail performance with pro-level components, unmatched adjustability, and a ferociously powerful motor system. The Trailblazer PRO takes the base Trailblazer with solid components and goes world-class with top of the line parts tip to tail.\n\nInsane Power & Range: More than 2X the power and torque of mainstream brands, paired with a HUGE USA-made 1050Wh 52V battery for up to 52 miles of thrilling range.\nPrecision Suspension: Custom-tuned 160mm DVO Onyx 38SL front fork and 155mm DVO Topaz Prime rear shock deliver plush, responsive control on any terrain.\nLight & Agile: At just 50 lbs (including battery for the 750W base model), the ultra-refined carbon chassis ensures nimble handling without sacrificing durability. A fully maxxed out Trailblazer PRO weighs only 55 lbs!\nVersatile Control: Unique torque-sensing pedal assist *and* thumb throttle for on-demand power, plus 11-52T gearing to conquer any climb—pedal or throttle-only.\nPremium Upgrades for 2026: e*Thirteen Carbon Flux DH 29\" rims, Sapim CX Ray spokes, One Up hubs, SRAM X0 TRANSMISSION (T-Type) wireless drivetrain, Full One Up components cockpit and a Rockshox Reverb AXS wireless dropper post.\n\nAfter two years of relentless development with DVO Suspension who helped us refine suspension kinematics and develop custom factory suspension tunes, we finally have the bike riders have been begging for—a true do-it-all lightweight trail machine built for rugged reliability, heart-pounding performance and top tier quality and components selection.\n\nWhether you’re shredding technical descents or cruising scenic trails, the Trailblazer PRO is your ticket to the ride of a lifetime!",
